meta {
  name: mark notification failed
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/failed
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "reason": "missing permissions (50013)"
  }
}

docs {
  What the bot could not send. The row is acked, because the same send would be refused
  again on the next lease, and the raid lead is told in the events channel that it did
  not arrive. Reason is the bot's own words, Discord's error code included: 50013 is a
  missing permission, 50007 is a raider with DMs closed.
}
